{title: He Is Coming}
{subtitle: Psalms 96:11–13}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 72}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] [F/A] | [Eb/G] | [Bb] [F/A] | [Eb/G] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
As[Bb]cribe to the [F/A]Lord the [Gm7]glory due his [Eb]name
[Cm7]Bring an [Bb]offering and [Eb]enter his [F]courts
[Bb]Worship the Lord [F/A]in the splen[Gm7]dor of ho[Eb]liness
[Cm7]Tremble before [Bb/D]him [Eb]all the [Fsus4]earth
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[F]The [Bb]Lord [F]reigns the world [Eb]stands [Bb]firm
It [Gm7]cannot be shak[F]en by [Eb]fear
[Bb]He will [F]judge the peo[Gm]ples [Eb]with fairness
The [Cm7]Lord is here [F]he is [Bb]near [Eb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]Say among the na[F/A]tions [Gm]that the Lord [Eb]reigns
[Cm7]The world [Bb]stands firm and [Eb]cannot be shak[F]en
[Bb]He will [F/A]judge the [Gm]peoples with [Eb]fairness
His [Cm7]word is [Bb/D]true his [Eb]promise re[Fsus4][F]mains
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
The [Bb]Lord [F]reigns the world [Eb]stands [Bb]firm
It [Gm]cannot be shak[F]en by [Eb]fear
[Bb]He [F]will judge the [Gm]peo[Eb]ples with fairness
[Cm7]The Lord is [F]here he is [Bb]near
