{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[F/A]Let the [Gm]heavens re[Eb]joice and the [Bb]earth be [F]glad
Let [Gm]the sea and [Eb]all that [Bb]fills it re[F]sound
[Gm]Let the field [Eb]exult [Bb]and everything [F]in it
[Eb]All the trees of the forest [F]will sing for joy
